      "created_at": "2023-02-04T06:14:59.325Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone!</p>\n<p>Started using ERPNext just yesterday and I want some customisation on my system.</p>\n<p>I want to write a script which would let me create a Custom button on the Homepage, but I am confused about what DocType to use and the ApplyTo.</p>\n<p>Please help me.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e\" title=\"IMG-20230204-WA0000~2\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e_2_690x308.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG-20230204-WA0000~2\" data-base62-sha1=\"fESt85tr83h9B3bM8VaHKb3oXJY\" width=\"690\" height=\"308\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e_2_690x308.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e_2_1035x462.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e_2_1380x616.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9F8\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG-20230204-WA0000~2</span><span class=\"informations\">1600×715 78.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Which DocType to select to make the Button appear on the Home Page?</p>",
