      "id": 459584,
      "username": "Gubbu77",
      "name": "Indrajith.vs",
      "created_at": "2025-03-02T13:13:57.441Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/erpnextnoob1\">@erpnextnoob1</a><br>\nThe class of that section is “page-actions”, you can insert the element you want.</p>\n<p>Eg:<br>\nAdd the JS file to app_include_js hooks or u can make it as bundle.<br>\nIn the JS on the onload of window.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$(window).on('load', function () {\n\tif (window.location.pathname == \"app/home\") {\n\t\tconst actions = $(\".page-actions\");\n\t\tconst already_added = $(\"#new_action\");\n\t\t\n\t\tif (!already_added) {\n\t\t\tactions.prepend(\"&lt;h1 id=`new_action`&gt;Hi&lt;/h1&gt;\");\n\t\t}\n\t}\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>You can replace this to a button or anything.</p>\n<p>Output:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb_2_690x105.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4r0WCc4d5LiXInQtQLxUyQ2KTmr\" width=\"690\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb_2_690x105.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb_2_1035x157.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f167891a40e54d91e7b72826ce51d8a85ead8fb.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1239×189 10.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards</p>",
